{"id":"mahabharata-5-144","work":"mahabharata","part":5,"partName":"उद्योगपर्व","partNameEn":"Udyoga Parva","unit":144,"title":"चतुश्चत्वारिंशदधिकशततमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 144 · Karna's promise to Kunti","summary":{"en":"A voice from the Sun confirms Kunti's words, but Karna reproaches her for abandoning him and refuses to desert Duryodhana, who trusts in him to cross the sea of battle. He promises her, however, that he will not kill any of her sons except Arjuna, so that she will still have five sons, with Arjuna or with himself.","kn":"ಸೂರ್ಯನಿಂದ ಬಂದ ವಾಣಿ ಕುಂತಿಯ ಮಾತನ್ನು ದೃಢಪಡಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಆದರೆ ತನ್ನನ್ನು ತೊರೆದದ್ದಕ್ಕಾಗಿ ಕರ್ಣನು ಅವಳನ್ನು ಆಕ್ಷೇಪಿಸಿ, ಯುದ್ಧಸಮುದ್ರ ದಾಟಲು ತನ್ನನ್ನು ನಂಬಿರುವ ದುರ್ಯೋಧನನನ್ನು ತೊರೆಯೆನು ಎನ್ನುತ್ತಾನೆ. ಆದರೂ ಅರ್ಜುನನನ್ನು ಬಿಟ್ಟು ಅವಳ ಬೇರೆ ಮಕ್ಕಳನ್ನು ಕೊಲ್ಲೆನು, ಅರ್ಜುನನಿಂದಾಗಲಿ ತನ್ನಿಂದಾಗಲಿ ಅವಳಿಗೆ ಐವರು ಮಕ್ಕಳಿರುವರು ಎಂದು ವಾಗ್ದಾನ ಮಾಡುತ್ತಾನೆ.","hi":"सूर्य से आई वाणी कुन्ती के वचनों की पुष्टि करती है, पर कर्ण उन्हें त्यागने के लिए उलाहना देता है और दुर्योधन को छोड़ने से मना करता है, जो युद्ध-सागर पार करने के लिए उस पर भरोसा करता है। फिर भी वह वचन देता है कि अर्जुन के अतिरिक्त वह उनके किसी पुत्र को नहीं मारेगा, ताकि अर्जुन सहित या उसके सहित उनके पाँच पुत्र बने रहें।","te":"సూర్యుని నుండి వచ్చిన వాణి కుంతి మాటలను ధృవీకరిస్తుంది, కానీ తనను విడిచిపెట్టినందుకు కర్ణుడు ఆమెను నిందించి, యుద్ధసముద్రం దాటడానికి తనపై ఆధారపడిన దుర్యోధనుని విడువనని అంటాడు. అయినా అర్జునుని తప్ప ఆమె ఇతర కుమారులను చంపనని, అర్జునునితోనో తనతోనో ఆమెకు ఐదుగురు కుమారులు ఉంటారని వాగ్దానం చేస్తాడు.","ta":"சூரியனிடமிருந்து வந்த குரல் குந்தியின் சொற்களை உறுதிப்படுத்துகிறது, ஆனால் தன்னைக் கைவிட்டதற்காகக் கர்ணன் அவளைக் கடிந்து, போர்க்கடலைக் கடக்கத் தன்னை நம்பியிருக்கும் துரியோதனனைக் கைவிட மாட்டேன் என்கிறான். இருப்பினும் அர்ஜுனனைத் தவிர அவளுடைய மற்ற மைந்தர்களைக் கொல்ல மாட்டேன், அர்ஜுனனுடனோ தன்னுடனோ அவளுக்கு ஐந்து மைந்தர்கள் இருப்பார்கள் என்று வாக்களிக்கிறான்.","ml":"കുന്തിയുടെ വാക്കുകൾ സൂര്യനിൽനിന്നുള്ള ശബ്ദം സ്ഥിരീകരിക്കുന്നു; എങ്കിലും ഉപേക്ഷിച്ചതിന് കർണ്ണൻ അവളെ ശാസിക്കുന്നു; യുദ്ധസാഗരം കടക്കാൻ തന്നിൽ വിശ്വസിക്കുന്ന ദുര്യോധനനെ ഉപേക്ഷിക്കാൻ അദ്ദേഹം വിസമ്മതിക്കുന്നു. പക്ഷേ, അർജുനനെയല്ലാതെ അവളുടെ മറ്റൊരു മകനെയും താൻ കൊല്ലില്ലെന്ന് അദ്ദേഹം വാഗ്ദാനം ചെയ്യുന്നു; അങ്ങനെ അർജുനനോടൊപ്പമോ തന്നോടൊപ്പമോ അവൾക്ക് അഞ്ചു മക്കളുണ്ടാകും."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 5.144; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Tue Jan 23 2024","sections":[{"title":"कर्णोपनिवादपर्व","titleEn":"Karnopanivada Parva (The secret talks with Karna)","verses":[{"text":"वैशंपायन उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Vaishampayana said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"ततः सूर्यान्निश्चरितां कर्णः शुश्राव भारतीम् ।\nदुरत्ययां प्रणयिनीं पितृवद्भास्करेरिताम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Karna heard a voice that came out of the Sun, affectionate, hard to resist, spoken by Bhaskara like a father."}},{"n":2,"text":"सत्यमाह पृथा वाक्यं कर्ण मातृवचः कुरु ।\nश्रेयस्ते स्यान्नरव्याघ्र सर्वमाचरतस्तथा ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"Pritha speaks the truth, Karna; do as your mother says. If you act in every way as she says, tiger among men, it will be best for you.\""}},{"n":3,"text":"एवमुक्तस्य मात्रा च स्वयं पित्रा च भानुना ।\nचचाल नैव कर्णस्य मतिः सत्यधृतेस्तदा ॥","meaning":{"en":"Though urged by his mother and by his father the Sun himself, Karna, firm in truth, did not waver in his mind."}},{"text":"कर्ण उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Karna said:"}},{"n":4,"text":"न ते न श्रद्दधे वाक्यं क्षत्रिये भाषितं त्वया ।\nधर्मद्वारं ममैतत्स्यान्नियोगकरणं तव ॥","meaning":{"en":"I do not trust what you say to me as a kshatriya; obeying your command would be a door to adharma for me."}},{"n":5,"text":"अकरोन्मयि यत्पापं भवती सुमहात्ययम् ।\nअवकीर्णोऽस्मि ते तेन तद्यशःकीर्तिनाशनम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"You did me a most grievous wrong by casting me away, and by that you destroyed my fame and renown."}},{"n":6,"text":"अहं च क्षत्रियो जातो न प्राप्तः क्षत्रसत्क्रियाम् ।\nत्वत्कृते किं नु पापीयः शत्रुः कुर्यान्ममाहितम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Though born a kshatriya, I did not receive a kshatriya's rites. What worse thing could an enemy do to harm me than you did?"}},{"n":7,"text":"क्रियाकाले त्वनुक्रोशमकृत्वा त्वमिमं मम ।\nहीनसंस्कारसमयमद्य मां समचूचुदः ॥","meaning":{"en":"At the time when mercy was needed you showed none to me, and now, when I have been left without the rites, you urge me."}},{"n":8,"text":"न वै मम हितं पूर्वं मातृवच्चेष्टितं त्वया ।\nसा मां संबोधयस्यद्य केवलात्महितैषिणी ॥","meaning":{"en":"You never acted for my good before as a mother should; yet today you advise me, wishing only your own good."}},{"n":9,"text":"कृष्णेन सहितात्को वै न व्यथेत धनंजयात् ।\nकोऽद्य भीतं न मां विद्यात्पार्थानां समितिं गतम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Who would not tremble before Dhananjaya with Krishna beside him? Who would not take me for afraid, if I went into the Pandavas' company today?"}},{"n":10,"text":"अभ्राता विदितः पूर्वं युद्धकाले प्रकाशितः ।\nपाण्डवान्यदि गच्छामि किं मां क्षत्रं वदिष्यति ॥","meaning":{"en":"I was never known as their brother, and it comes out only now, at the time of war. If I go to the Pandavas, what will the kshatriyas say of me?"}},{"n":11,"text":"सर्वकामैः संविभक्तः पूजितश्च सदा भृशम् ।\nअहं वै धार्तराष्ट्राणां कुर्यां तदफलं कथम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Always richly honored and given every desire by the sons of Dhritarashtra, how could I make that fruitless?"}},{"n":12,"text":"उपनह्य परैर्वैरं ये मां नित्यमुपासते ।\nनमस्कुर्वन्ति च सदा वसवो वासवं यथा ॥","meaning":{"en":"They who serve me constantly, having taken up enmity with others, and bow to me as the Vasus bow to Vasava,"}},{"n":13,"text":"मम प्राणेन ये शत्रूञ्शक्ताः प्रतिसमासितुम् ।\nमन्यन्तेऽद्य कथं तेषामहं भिन्द्यां मनोरथम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"who expect, by my life, to be able to face their enemies: how could I break their hopes today?"}},{"n":14,"text":"मया प्लवेन संग्रामं तितीर्षन्ति दुरत्ययम् ।\nअपारे पारकामा ये त्यजेयं तानहं कथम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Those who wish to cross the uncrossable battle with me as their boat, seeking the far shore where there is none, how could I abandon them?"}},{"n":15,"text":"अयं हि कालः संप्राप्तो धार्तराष्ट्रोपजीविनाम् ।\nनिर्वेष्टव्यं मया तत्र प्राणानपरिरक्षता ॥","meaning":{"en":"This time has come for those who live on the sons of Dhritarashtra; I must repay it without sparing my life."}},{"n":16,"text":"कृतार्थाः सुभृता ये हि कृत्यकाल उपस्थिते ।\nअनवेक्ष्य कृतं पापा विकुर्वन्त्यनवस्थिताः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Those who, when well kept and fulfilled, behave without steadiness when the time for service comes, taking no thought of what was done for them,"}},{"n":17,"text":"राजकिल्बिषिणां तेषां भर्तृपिण्डापहारिणाम् ।\nनैवायं न परो लोको विद्यते पापकर्मणाम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"those sinners, who wrong their king and rob their master's meal, have neither this world nor the next."}},{"n":18,"text":"धृतराष्ट्रस्य पुत्राणामर्थे योत्स्यामि ते सुतैः ।\nबलं च शक्तिं चास्थाय न वै त्वय्यनृतं वदे ॥","meaning":{"en":"I will fight your sons for the sake of Dhritarashtra's sons, with all my strength and power. I tell you no lie in this."}},{"n":19,"text":"आनृशंस्यमथो वृत्तं रक्षन्सत्पुरुषोचितम् ।\nअतोऽर्थकरमप्येतन्न करोम्यद्य ते वचः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Keeping to gentleness and the conduct fit for a good man, I do not do what you say today, though it would serve my interest."}},{"n":20,"text":"न तु तेऽयं समारम्भो मयि मोघो भविष्यति ।\nवध्यान्विषह्यान्संग्रामे न हनिष्यामि ते सुतान् ।\nयुधिष्ठिरं च भीमं च यमौ चैवार्जुनादृते ॥","meaning":{"en":"But this effort of yours will not be wholly in vain with me. I will not kill your sons in battle, though they are killable and could be overcome: not Yudhishthira, Bhima, or the twins, apart from Arjuna."}},{"n":21,"text":"अर्जुनेन समं युद्धं मम यौधिष्ठिरे बले ।\nअर्जुनं हि निहत्याजौ संप्राप्तं स्यात्फलं मया ।\nयशसा चापि युज्येयं निहतः सव्यसाचिना ॥","meaning":{"en":"My battle will be with Arjuna in Yudhishthira's army. If I kill Arjuna in battle, I will have gained the fruit; or if I am killed by Savyasachin, I shall be joined with fame."}},{"n":22,"text":"न ते जातु नशिष्यन्ति पुत्राः पञ्च यशस्विनि ।\nनिरर्जुनाः सकर्णा वा सार्जुना वा हते मयि ॥","meaning":{"en":"Glorious lady, you will never be without five sons: either without Arjuna and with Karna, or with Arjuna, when I am slain.\""}},{"text":"वैशंपायन उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Vaishampayana said:"}},{"n":23,"text":"इति कर्णवचः श्रुत्वा कुन्ती दुःखात्प्रवेपती ।\nउवाच पुत्रमाश्लिष्य कर्णं धैर्यादकम्पितम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Hearing Karna's words, Kunti, trembling with grief, embraced her son Karna, unshaken in his steadiness, and said:"}},{"n":24,"text":"एवं वै भाव्यमेतेन क्षयं यास्यन्ति कौरवाः ।\nयथा त्वं भाषसे कर्ण दैवं तु बलवत्तरम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"So it must be, and the Kauravas will perish, just as you say, Karna; fate is stronger."}},{"n":25,"text":"त्वया चतुर्णां भ्रातॄणामभयं शत्रुकर्शन ।\nदत्तं तत्प्रतिजानीहि संगरप्रतिमोचनम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Tormentor of foes, you have given safety to four of my sons; remember that promise, to be kept in the battle.\""}},{"n":26,"text":"अनामयं स्वस्ति चेति पृथाथो कर्णमब्रवीत् ।\nतां कर्णोऽभ्यवदत्प्रीतस्ततस्तौ जग्मतुः पृथक् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Pritha said to Karna, \"May you be well and healthy.\" Karna replied to her affectionately, and then the two went their separate ways."}}]}]}